== BonusManager.xml
== Scheduled server-wide bonus events (extra experience/drop
== rate, etc): when each one starts (StartTime), how long it
== runs and what messages it broadcasts, and what bonus values
== it applies.
== Loaded by GameServer via CBonusManager::LoadXML().
== Modify only if you know what you're doing!
============================================================

### BonusManager::Bonus ###
	Index          0-29, fixed (MAX_BONUS).
	StartMessage   Message index (see Message_<LANG>.txt) broadcast when
	               this bonus starts. -1 = none.
	FinalMessage   Message index broadcast when this bonus ends. -1 = none.
	BonusTime      Duration in seconds once started.

	Child <StartTime> - one or more scheduled triggers, matched against
	the real-world clock (-1 = any/wildcard for that field):
		Year/Month/Day/DayOfWeek/Hour/Minute/Second

	Child <Value> - one or more bonus effects applied while active:
		BonusIndex   eBonusIndex value (BonusManager.h) - 0=Experience
		             Rate, 1=Master Experience Rate, 2=Item Drop Rate,
		             3=Common Item Drop Rate, 4=Excellent Item Drop
		             Rate, 5=Set Item Drop Rate, 6=Goblin Point,
		             7=Reset Amount, 8=Master Reset Amount.
		Value0-3     Bonus magnitude per VIP AccountLevel tier (0-3).
		ItemIndex/
		ItemLevel    Restricts the bonus to a specific item/level.
		             -1 = any.
		MapNumber    Restricts the bonus to one map. -1 = any.
		MonsterClass Restricts the bonus to one monster class. -1 = any.
		MonsterLevelMin/MonsterLevelMax  Restricts the bonus to a
		             monster level range. -1 = no restriction.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

<BonusManager>
	<Bonus Index="0" StartMessage="-1" FinalMessage="-1" BonusTime="86400">
